{"title":"ICE’s Plan to Monitor Social Media 24/7","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/ices-plan-to-monitor-social-media","date":1772226350000,"content":"<p>Last year, Meta, Apple, and other big tech platforms began mass removing content and apps related to ICE. They deleted Facebook groups whose members criticized ICE agents, and forced the removal of apps from the app store that allowed citizens to report ICE in their neighborhood. Overall, it’s becoming harder and harder to criticize ICE online. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>The Foundation for Individual Rights and Expression (FIRE), is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yrPpMjdQvK8\">suing the government</a> to fight back against these efforts. Today, Colin McDonnell, an attorney at FIRE <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yrPpMjdQvK8\">joins me</a> to break down FIRE’s lawsuit representing a Chicago-based Facebook group owner and an anti-ICE app founder against the government. <br /><br />We discuss how DOJ and DHS officials, including Pam Bondi and Kristi Noem, successfully pressured Apple and Facebook to remove an ICE-tracking app and a Chicago-based Facebook group with nearly 100,000 members. Colin breaks down why FIRE is suing the government , whether recording law enforcement in public is protected speech or dangerous \"doxing,” the threats of a secret ICE protester database, and more!! <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yrPpMjdQvK8\">WATCH NOW</a>!</p><div><div></div></div><div><div><div><p>To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L2Dj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c26e65f-09a0-45b9-a784-9d65dae4e397_2670x822.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L2Dj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c26e65f-09a0-45b9-a784-9d65dae4e397_2670x822.png\" width=\"579\" height=\"178.25393258426968\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L2Dj!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c26e65f-09a0-45b9-a784-9d65dae4e397_2670x822.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L2Dj!,w_848,c_lim