ood,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bda8ca2-139d-4939-aa26-5b76e20d1155_5472x2450.jpeg\" width=\"515\" height=\"230.5829678362573\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CBPt!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bda8ca2-139d-4939-aa26-5b76e20d1155_5472x2450.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CBPt!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bda8ca2-139d-4939-aa26-5b76e20d1155_5472x2450.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CBPt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bda8ca2-139d-4939-aa26-5b76e20d1155_5472x2450.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CBPt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bda8ca2-139d-4939-aa26-5b76e20d1155_5472x2450.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h2>What I’m reading</h2><p><strong>Salish Matter Got 87,000 Fans to Go to the Mall. Then Netflix Came Calling</strong> </p><p>The teen influencer Is a YouTube sensation, Sephora success story and coming soon to a streaming device near you.- <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/3vXiv#selection-1181.0-1187.113\">WSJ</a></em></p><p><strong>Online Accusations in Guthrie Abduction Leave One Family ‘Scared Numb’</strong> </p><p>A fifth-grade teacher and his principal wife hid in their bedroom as dozens of people who believed he might be a kidnapper appeared on their suburban street. - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/25/us/nancy-guthrie-true-crime-accusations.html?unlocked_article_code=1.O1A.Oqpd.3bNXR8QbLxBg&amp;smid=nytcore-ios-share\">NY Times</a></em></p><p><strong>AI Will Never Be Conscious</strong> </p><p>Michael Pollan argues that artificial intelligence can do many things, it just can’t be a person. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/book-excerpt-a-world-appears-michael-pollan\">WIRED</a></em></p><p><strong>Kids Show Us What They’re Into, From Pokémon to Pop Stars</strong></p><p>We gave them disposable cameras to document their stuff, in all its glittery, sporty, nerdy glory. - <em><a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2026-gen-alpha-rooms-obsessions/\">Bloomberg</a></em></p><p><strong>My Life as a Sex Worker at a Nevada Brothel</strong> </p><p>Men come to me for sex, yes. But in an age of profound loneliness and disconnection, they turn out to be looking for so much more. - <em><a href=\"https://www.esquire.com/lifestyle/a70422997/sex-worker-nevada-brothel/\">Esquire</a></em></p><p><strong>All the looksmaxxers are getting personality-mogged</strong> </p><p>The newly notorious streamer Clavicular has a sharp jawline but no charisma. As his movement goes mainstream, its lack of genuine sex appeal is getting increasingly obvious. - <em><a href=\"https://www.gq-magazine.co.uk/article/all-the-looksmaxxers-are-getting-personality-mogged\">GQ</a></em></p><p><strong>How Chinese AI Chatbots Censor Themselves</strong> </p><p>Researchers from Stanford and Princeton found that Chinese AI models are more likely than their Western counterparts to dodge political questions or deliver inaccurate answers. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/made-in-china-how-chinese-ai-chatbots-censor-themselves/\">WIRED</a></em></p><p><strong>A World Where All Is Free? That’s Elon Musk’s Theory of ‘Sustainable Abundance.’</strong> </p><p>The Tesla and SpaceX chief has told his followers that they will live in a world where robots will take care of every need and people do not have to work, in what has become his latest slogan. - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/a-world-where-all-is-free-thats-elon-musks-theory-of-sustainable-abundance.html?unlocked_article_code=1.PVA.ENWf.wi1JnNXzCT0G&amp;smid=url-share\">NY Times</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown </h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!puzt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4c7c5ed4-9bfd-4c0b-9454-9f0940